#. module: my_compassion
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:my_compassion.my2_user_settings_page
msgid ""
"Compassion knows that children living in extreme\n"
"                                        poverty are vulnerable.\n"
"                                        We put their protection as our "
"number one priority.\n"
"                                        We ask our volunteering\n"
"                                        friends and people that travel to "
"visit their\n"
"                                        sponsored child to sign a\n"
"                                        child protection charter. If you "
"want to make a step\n"
"                                        further, you can sign\n"
"                                        this document as well and show us "
"that you share our\n"
"                                        values.\n"
"                                        <br/>\n"
"                                        Compassion is\n"
"                                        also serious about the protection of "
"your data. All\n"
"                                        your information is kept private and "
"only used\n"
"                                        internally. You can sign or review "
"our data\n"
"                                        protection policy from here."
msgstr ""
"Compassion sait que les enfants vivant dans une extrême\n"
"                                        pauvreté sont vulnérables.\n"
"                                        Nous faisons de leur protection "
"notre priorité absolue.\n"
"                                        Nous demandons à nos amis\n"
"                                        bénévoles et aux personnes qui "
"voyagent pour rendre visite à leur\n"
"                                        filleul de signer une\n"
"                                        charte de protection de l'enfant. Si "
"vous souhaitez aller plus\n"
"                                        loin, vous pouvez également signer\n"
"                                        ce document et nous montrer que vous "
"partagez nos\n"
"                                        valeurs.\n"
"                                        <br/>\n"
"                                        Compassion prend\n"
"                                        également très au sérieux la "
"protection de vos données. Toutes\n"
